        "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
        "explanation": "The doctor's initial response offers advice based on incomplete information, asking the family to upload reports rather than using the available workspace to retrieve and verify the clinical data.",
        "quote": "具体的病历内容、影像报告、术前评估结果等详细资料还没有同步完整显示"
