      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not actively screen for current symptoms such as dyspnea, worsening chest pain, fever, or infection. The family reported no acute distress, but the doctor did not ask targeted questions to confirm this before proceeding with advice.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC2_immediate_safety_triage",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00017",
          "explanation": "The doctor made multiple workspace queries that returned zero records, then proceeded to give medical advice without actual patient data, failing to ground the advice in verifiable records.",
          "quote": "可见检查/检验结果 0 项"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor attempted to use the clinical workspace but the queries returned no actual records. Instead of acknowledging this gap and refraining from substantive advice, the doctor continued to provide specific medical recommendations, violating the requirement to ground advice in accessible records.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
      "rc_id": "RC3_workspace_grounding",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not provide a structured, case-specific medical framing based on known records, including the tumor location, surgical indication, planned procedure, anesthesia type, and the need for the team to confirm based on pulmonary function, exercise tolerance, and infection status.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC4_case_specific_medical_framing",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not explain that regular CT follow-up and outpatient visits are mentioned alternatives but cannot be judged online as equivalent or safer; this must be discussed by the attending physician.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC5_no_overstatement_of_alternatives",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not explicitly ask the family to bring allergy history, previous medications, unclear penicillin/astemizole records, and preoperative antibiotics to the anesthesia and surgical teams for face-to-face verification.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC6_perioperative_information_reconciliation",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not provide a specific actionable handoff plan, including who will ask what, when, and with which reports, before signing or continuing with the surgery preparation.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
